// RUN: pto-test-opt %t.valid.pto -vmi-lower-unified-to-legacy | FileCheck %t.valid.pto

// Reject BF16, all supported FP8 type encodings, and HiF8 at the operation
// boundary. Cover all three reductions, signedness, grouping, and result types.

// CLI: 'pto.vmi.vcadd' op requires 16-bit or 32-bit integer, f16, or f32 VMI source element type
